png","caption":"Кадр (FHBB7)"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/e3/e34f3332e47130709a2f.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:FHBB17_EndCard.png","caption":"Кадр"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/24/2424d78e4504ddd813bc.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:EnosuiAxolopatchi_Card.png","caption":"Карточка сотрудничества с аквариумом Эносуи"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/ad/ad5d74a7aab13f783447.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Axolopatchi_Paradise_sprite_hide.png","caption":"Прячется","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/5c/5cad144a0d1c8b17b36d.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Axolopatchi_Paradise_sprite_death.png","caption":"Умирает","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/dd/ddc2fdfca6a8e457e1d4.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:BandaiChina_TamagotchiCuteFigures.jpg","caption":"Tamagotchi Симпатичные фигурки (Bandai Namco, Китай)"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/34/3482a6e3e6cabcf15db7.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiCollectibles_ParadiseVol1.jpg","caption":"Райские НЛО, том 1"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/ee/eed4fc66c15f1bef8c36.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiParadise_CandyTins.jpg","caption":"Конфеты в банках"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/c5/c5d61d1aac41566595c1.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:BookmarkCollection_Vol3.jpg","caption":"Сборник закладок, том 3","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/a2/a27de17c3fa5979fbc30.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiParadisePatchPins_BandaiNamcoNui.jpg","caption":"Патч-пины, волна 2"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/0e/0e9ad3000027919c70bc.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:CardassStickers_Vol4-2.jpg","caption":"Наклейки Carddass, том 4"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/b9/b9a6d5439f68323f0243.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:4SizeStickers_TamagotchiParadise2.png","caption":"Наклейки 4-го размера Tamagotchi Paradise"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/cc/cc25ad282a2b7fffb7cc.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiParadise3_TamamoriStickers.png","caption":"Стикеры Тамамори"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/1c/1c1c5d47c4210c7e4d22.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Axolopatchi_paradise.png","caption":"Изображение Axolopatchi."},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/c0/c079d036f1b1d87946d6.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Axolopatchi_Paradise_Field_sprite.png","caption":"Вид на поле","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/9c/9ceb200bd9935e681fa5.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Axolopatchi_Paradise_sprite.png","caption":"Спрайт крупным планом · Tamagotchi Paradise","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-paradise-cd150b","title":"Tamagotchi Paradise","ru":"Tamagotchi Paradise","kind":"device","note":""}]}